(footprint "SW_Toggle_SPDT_Marquardt_9070-1W"
	(version 20240108)
	(generator "s5cpu")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "SPDT miniature toggle, Marquardt 9070-1W, right-angle PCB mount: the RESET/RUN toggle of Ken's YACC1 (its sequencer-logic card's RESET, SS/WAIT and STEP-CLK; YACC1-D hardware/cards/sequencer-logic/kicad/v2.1, footprint 9070-1W from Eagle's switch library, 'TOGGLE SWITCH, Marquardt'). Same pads and outline, the origin moved to terminal 2 (the common): terminals 1-3 on 2.54 mm (0.81 mm holes), two bracket legs 5.08 mm behind them (1.12 mm holes); body 10.8 x 8.9 mm, then the bushing and lever, towards -x. On YACC1 the body ends at the board edge and the bushing and lever stand out past it. Drawn 2026-11-18 for S5BUS-D (Ken: the power switch to be YACC1's RESET/RUN model); here CPU Rev D's RESET/RUN switch (Ken, the same day).")
	(tags "switch toggle SPDT right angle Marquardt 9070-1W YACC1")
